<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2JN" style="id">2YOH ARUM</book>
  <para style="h">2 AYOHANA</para>
  <para style="toc1">2 Ayohana</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Ayohana</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Yoh</para>
  <para style="mt2">AMGBASHO ATA AFRI ANYI NA</para>
  <para style="mt1">AYOHANA</para>
  <para style="imt">IKPI TSIFA</para>
  <para style="im">Amgbasho Ayohana ata na afri reh a bu Ayohana mi a ŋa a na kyangwri mboh.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2JN 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2JN 1:1" />Amgbasho ata areh Anyi na amya Ayohana Agba kyangwri ata ida Nnoh reh. Mya meh ŋa ba nnoh afiya ata Nnoh nza a seh nnoh a gya, tasa mara anzoh mboh, ata mya meh kira na amohnoh zizi reh, a bu mya tsi, neh a bu amboh ata nza ma a wina zizi reh za ma a kira na anzoh. <verse eid="2JN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2JN 1:2" />Tsifa la a zizi reh a bu na ambohroh tasa za a nati a tuma na ambohroh atsi tuma atono.<verse eid="2JN 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2JN 1:3" />Lisa alindeh, kwini tasa tuma alindeh ata Nnoh Ada reh, tasa Yeso Kristi Amehreh Alehmeh reh, ma nati a bu na ambohroh nimeh a zizi tasa kira.<verse eid="2JN 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">A zizi Tasa kira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2JN 1:4" />A nga meh nana agohsoh meh nza la mgbiri mara anzoh mboh ma buti hende nimeh a zizi, tswanza Ada reh nza a bleh reh. <verse eid="2JN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2JN 1:5" />Nehnehreh meh leh kwere nnoh afiya reh la meh ti kira na itoh ambohroh. Areh a bu andromboh afeh kpeh. A bu andromboh ata meh ti kǝ jiji wina reh mi. <verse eid="2JN 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2JN 1:6" />Ata areh a bu kira reh: la meh ti hende kuku ikpi nimeh akpi Nnoh reh. Tswanza nza ni sere nyi nnoh ma jiji reh, akpi a ŋoh reh a bu la meh ti hende nimeh kira.<verse eid="2JN 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2JN 1:7" />Meh bleh dehreh la Kyangwri mboh gaga amboh agugu ma a kate a hehndeh a treh akpokpo atsifi nambri ma inziyo agba areh. Ma a kira la Yeso Kristi a ba inziyo reh na itoh kyangwri kpeh. Kyangwri mboh ikata areh ma bu amboh landa mboh tasa ma bu amboh fi kristi ma tohmoh. <verse eid="2JN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2JN 1:8" />Lisa nza noh, la andromboh ata nza ni lisa noh ta a kama a bu wusu kpeh, dehreh neh, shi ti hunji noh avu amohnoh gaga. <verse eid="2JN 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2JN 1:9" />Akyo wohroh ata nza a shi ma ikpi tsana Yeso Kristi kpeh, neh ta ka a fi andromboh ata ikpi a ŋoh, kyangwri reh a bu na Nnoh kpeh. Akyo neh ata nza a shi ma ikpi tsana Kristi, a bu na Ada tasa Amehreh. <verse eid="2JN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2JN 1:10" />Nza akyo a ba na anzoh tasa a de tsana ata areh kpeh, kama wa ŋoh na mgba afiya anzoh ha ti sa ŋoh. <verse eid="2JN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2JN 1:11" />Akyo ata nza sa ŋoh ma te agugu mboh ma a ŋoh.<verse eid="2JN 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2JN 1:12" />Meh bu na mgbiri tsifa mboh gaga ata meh kira ti ŋa ba nnoh, Mya neh meh kira meh ti ŋa ma amgbasho ata areh kpeh. meh nza dehreh neh, meh bu ti fa aki meh ti ba na amohnoh meh ti lisa tuma tsifa meh ti nza noh mohnoh ti nza meh noh, la nana agohsoh ambohroh ta a bu na su<verse eid="2JN 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2JN 1:13" />Mara asra amohnoh ata ma ta ka a seh ŋoh reh la ma atsifa na amohnoh.<verse eid="2JN 1:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2JN 1" />
</usx>